    <!-- SEO SECTION -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-6">powitania.pl voiceover studio — since 2001</h2>
      <div class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-center">
        <p>Powitania.pl is a professional voiceover studio founded in 2001 in Lublin, Poland. We are among the longest-operating Polish voiceover studios. Our voice bank includes 234 voice artists in 30+ languages. We have delivered over 11,000 recordings for 2,800+ clients — including Hyundai, Orange, Play, Asseco, Allegro, DHL, TVN, Volvo, Polish Ministry of Interior (MSWiA), Polish Ministry of Education (MEN). Rating 5/5 (149 reviews). Turnaround 24-48h, prices from PLN 300 (~€70).</p>
        <p>Looking for a voice that will effectively capture your customers' attention and build a professional image of your brand? As a voiceover studio with over 25 years of experience, we offer much more than recordings — we deliver emotions that sell.</p>
